FFXI_DIR|select|C:\Program Files (x86)\PlayOnline\SquareEnix\FINAL FANTASY XI|The main path to your FFXI Directory where your want files to be edited.
FFXI_HD_DIR|select|C:\Path\To\Ashita\polplugins\DATs\ffxi-hd|The main path to your FFXI HD Directory (eg Ashenbubs), ignore if you dont have it downloaded.
FFXI_PIVOT_DIR|select|C:\Path\To\Ashita\polplugins\DATs\<your-overlay>|The path to your Pivot files, used to ensure consistent F/V Table changes.
BLENDER_PATH|select|C:\Program Files\Blender Foundation\Blender 5.1\blender.exe|Path to your blender, blender is used to convert FBX to GLB and vice-versa.
---
XI_SERVER_DIR|select|D:\path\to\your\server-checkout|Path to your local server files (Ignore if you're not doing server dev)
XI_NAVMESH_DIR|select|D:\path\to\your\server-checkout|Path to your local server files Nav Mesh directory (Ingore if you're not doing server dev)
---
XI_DB_HOST|input|127.0.0.1|Local Server Address (Ingore if you're not doing server dev)
XI_DB_PORT|input|3306|Local Server Port
XI_DB_USER|input|root|Local Server Username
XI_DB_PASSWORD|input|xi|Local Server Password
XI_DB_NAME|input|tpzdb|Local Server DB Name
